      "cat-harness:section": "Covers",
      "prov:value": "A folio document, a paper, a library entry and an IG page all use the same dialog, from the tools layer `src/core/edit-links.ts` (`EDIT_LINKS_RUNTIME`, the suggest section) and its published copy `site-chrome/assets/js/edit-links.js`. Bean folio-assistant-4dx7, and dth-hrh tasks #8, #12, #13 and #16.",
