      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Who it is for",
      "prov:value": "The owner has low dexterity. Every control must be a large target, reachable by keyboard, and a choice rather than typing wherever possible."
    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/wireframes/suggest-editor/intent.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "What they need to do",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-10-14, on the first build: *\"i thought there would be a small toolbar (bold, underline, etc.). also would expect it to be resizable. new things in green, underlined. deleted things in red/marktrhough. the github issue has a why... cant we preopulate that with a field \"why\" in the popup?\"*",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ],
